            "review_title": "Review at La Beylicale",
            "review_text": "Lorenzo C\n1 contribution\n0\nPhenomenal biscuits !\nSep 2025 • Solo\nI recently visited this charming pastry shop and was really surprised. The shop itself is elegant and the staff were very friendly and gracious. I sampled a little bit of everything: tiramisu, Tunisian pastries, and a variety of biscuits.\n\nEverything was fresh, perfectly balanced in sweetness, and of high end quality. A special shout out to the biscuits !!! absolutely phenomenal ! The biscuits with the strawberry marmelade (forgot what they are called), croquants, and the pistachio petit fours are hands down the best store bought biscuits I’ve had in Tunisia. You can really taste the real butter in every bite.\n\nKeep up the fantastic work, please don’t drop in quality ! Highly recommended !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 23, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
